Subject: Fix downloads stalling forever on file reference refreshes. Waiting requesters stay attached to the server answer, and a parent with no refresh request no longer leaves them mapped.

---
 .../telegram/messenger/FileRefController.java | 61 ++++++++++++++++---
 1 file changed, 54 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/messenger/FileRefController.java b/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/messenger/FileRefController.java
index 0000000..0000000 100644
